  "headline": "Oxycodone and acetaminophen is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale Lakeside holds 13.9 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D5", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows oxycodone and acetaminophen is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 526 tablets at 16.6 per day for 31.6 days on hand; Corvale General holds 493 tablets at 18.9 per day for 26.1 days on hand; Corvale Lakeside holds 76 tablets at 5.5 per day for 13.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General also holds 512 units of the 5 mg/5 mL solution at 19.5 per day for 26.2 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407) shows a registered plant with a VAI inspection on 2026-07-16.",
      "cites": ["E16", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That plant received an OAI classification in 2009 and a Warning Letter on 2010-04-08, followed by multiple VAI inspections through 2026.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E15", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12", "E13", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Alvogen, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternate manufacturers Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC and Amneal Pharmaceuticals of New York LLC are also not on the shortage list and have no placeable plant on their labels.",
      "cites": ["D7", "D8"]
    }
  ]
}
